{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6a2bf9796da2c2bd9d2bd055047d501ca20af8a42486a1edebab64a6fbc1d8e", "ja": "（ペンギンとひなたのライブイベントは大盛況で\n終わった。もう帰る時間だけど、ひなたの様子は……）", "zh": "（企鹅和日向的现场活动在一片盛况中落幕了。已经到了该回去的时间，可日向的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "545ffe38422b44c7ca4b0ae82f2e7d472da3eadd0e159173ff609c5a14bd3c51", "ja": "……ん……ヒナ太……ペンギンたち……\nありがとねぇ……むにゃ……。", "zh": "……嗯……小日向……企鹅们……\n谢谢你们呀……唔喵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9ed7c7c8e900f531c0829566b1ec196eb9fa4aff0386778a2a65f881523d6d29", "ja": "（椅子に横になったまま、寝ちゃったのか。\n今日のライブ、頑張ってたもんな……）", "zh": "（就这样躺在椅子上睡着了吗。今天的演唱会，她也一直很努力啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "4248fcf2ca59cafcb1e044060764cf3bed2b0f612c4509d37b75e4f79e4f5eda", "ja": "んん……。あ、{$P$}？\nありゃ……あたし、寝ちゃってたのかい？", "zh": "嗯……啊，{$P$}？\n哎呀……我刚才睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e1f3fb6df81963efbb4fe63cb88ef166ff187aca848c0610c55eb86e1795e52", "ja": "ああ。動物との慣れないライブで疲れたんだろう。\n時間ならまだ少しあるから、休んでていいぞ。", "zh": "嗯。和动物一起进行不习惯的演出，肯定累了吧。\n时间还早，你再休息一会儿也行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "40014441e438b9107c9500fb3513775fd8ad946f71d14ec9998b2cdfa4f92844", "ja": "ううん、もう大丈夫だよぉ。\nちょっと眠ったら、疲れも消えた気がするべさ。", "zh": "不用啦，我已经没事了呀～。\n稍微睡了一觉，感觉疲倦也都消退了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cfe097f9e5aaa77c8bcf68d0df2c48c0e71aedbcd4f1b01873a2f36b4415d3d0", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。ひなた、今日はお疲れ様。\nお客さんたちもすごく盛り上がってたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。ひなた，今天辛苦了。\n观众们也都特别兴奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "763f8eb643d3c56911e265b821f5541be828b8509772076d237f7e4a4a47a527", "ja": "えへへ、よかったぁ。ペンギンと一緒に歌うって\n聞いた時は、なまら驚いたけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了。听说要和企鹅一起唱歌的时候，我可惊讶了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "2d90c454fe6d783aa20a8881afb8f6778a8242728fc23e693474234837bb6d0f", "ja": "ペンギンのヒナ太たちと歌って、踊って……\nあたしも、とっても楽しかったよぉ。", "zh": "和企鹅宝宝们一起唱歌、跳舞……我也特别开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "ac1064ca8da6d443aead9ffced888edd1aa7e3076d6332d2e4129cf1af7fec42", "ja": "それにしても、ヒナ太はすごいねぇ。\nあたしの歌に合わせて、かわいく鳴いてくれるなんて。", "zh": "不过话说回来，雏太真厉害呢。居然会配合我的歌声，可爱地叫起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c75888bf8ff7e7ada35d817be682a3e7b357de9d2b3fd3f33fa1e484cb55960e", "ja": "ああ。最初はビックリしたけど……本番がはじまったら\nひなたと息が合ってて、仲良しに見えたよ。", "zh": "啊。刚开始确实吓了一跳，不过……正式演出开始后，你和日向配合得很默契，看起来关系很亲密呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "a0f63b69d678d6e7c083845ec963ec65180c78639f66009341ba1eee70f44190", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、うれしいねぇ。あたしもね……\nなんだかヒナ太と心が通じ合ってる感じがしたんだ。", "zh": "听你这么说，我很开心呢。我也觉得……不知怎么的，好像和小雏太心意相通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "784a3c5536eceaa9c20bb0eb966be5e0e8885827ac04ce642daa2ae7b65ddad7", "ja": "だからかな……その分、お別れするのが、\nちょっとさびしくて……。", "zh": "所以吧……也正因为这样，分别的时候，\n才会觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ffc3bf9118d1688fdeb940bb0ad697bd9d82190faa91e246bc3f3bb6c04db389", "ja": "ひなた……。よし！　すぐは難しいけど、\nこの場所でライブができるように、企画を考えるよ。", "zh": "日向……好！虽然马上办到有点难，但我会想想企划，争取能在这里举办演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "77094354c81baa63d9992b79d0cae5e5a1d130ad2fb8f78e48a1b3eff12d08ef", "ja": "わぁ、本当かい？\nありがとねぇ、{$P$}！", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0413_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "f71f325806285bbcb22234321ba34048f96f65b4c8a83559e11fb1cbb5295de7", "ja": "ヒナ太たちと、また会えるように……。\nあたしもお仕事、がんばるべさ！", "zh": "为了能再次见到雏太他们……我也会努力工作的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
